   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "hisim.components (+ the component model, subcomponents)\ncomponent model: component, dynamic_component, sim_repository,\npart_load, explicit_state_controller, fluid_loops\nhisim.components.<folder>: one folder per component, its __init__ the\npublic API; no component imports another (interim allow-list)\nhisim.subcomponents: plain device parts\nanswers the orchestrator once at the end of the run: outputs, metadata, its\nrecord, KPI entries, cost facts",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "p-components",
   "originalText": "hisim.components (+ the component model, subcomponents)\ncomponent model: component, dynamic_component, sim_repository,\npart_load, explicit_state_controller, fluid_loops\nhisim.components.<folder>: one folder per component, its __init__ the\npublic API; no component imports another (interim allow-list)\nhisim.subcomponents: plain device parts\nanswers the orchestrator once at the end of the run: outputs, metadata, its\nrecord, KPI entries, cost facts",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
