   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 55338125,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 210722256,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the rules of the map:\n\n1. imports go down only:\na layer imports the layers\nbelow it, never above.\n\n2. siblings never import\neach other: components,\npostprocessing and economics\nmeet only through the\ncontracts layer.\n\n3. the orchestration imports\nevery sibling and sequences\nthem; nothing else does.\n\n4. a sibling or the contracts\nnever knows a component\nclass; postprocessing and\neconomics read the frozen\nrun record only.\n\n5. across a package boundary\nonly the public API (__all__)\nis imported.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "the rules of the map:\n\n1. imports go down only:\na layer imports the layers\nbelow it, never above.\n\n2. siblings never import\neach other: components,\npostprocessing and economics\nmeet only through the\ncontracts layer.\n\n3. the orchestration imports\nevery sibling and sequences\nthem; nothing else does.\n\n4. a sibling or the contracts\nnever knows a component\nclass; postprocessing and\neconomics read the frozen\nrun record only.\n\n5. across a package boundary\nonly the public API (__all__)\nis imported.",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
